iter yields 409. No foreign document data in those responses. Separate candidate ordering, not a proven leakage of document content.',AVD_boundary:'Isolated fixture 0021 reserved for A09. This sealed R2 does not claim execution of the AVD→ERP route. Later artifacts go to R3.'},A11_rework:[{id:'A11/A05/P1-1',status:'VERIFICAT_CU_LIMITA_FUNCȚIONALĂ',outcome:'F01 duplicate, real new event, compensare and delta costs measured. No dedicated reversal linked to initial note demonstrated.'},{id:'A11/A05/P1-2',status:'EXECUTAT_CU_DELIMITARE',outcome:'Rename/reactivation/native import, initial seed boot vs installed, and native race with two serial controls. Cold boot incident from R1 undisturbed; R2 was prepared snapshot.'},{id:'A11/A05/P1-3',status:'PARTIAL',outcome:'Policy oracles for allocation and destination located. Multi-G1 and pair stock traced. Full S1→distributed locators→pick→aviz→RMA/AWB on the same order remains an outstanding cross-zone E2E, not displaced by native movement/returns findings.'},{id:'A11/A05/P2',status:'PARTIAL',outcome:'Five legacy hashes, 6 cross-zone report bindings, mobile API two real tenants with required negatives and rights. The connected AVD, physical scanner and complete device UX remain separate.'}],related_reports:'A05/corelari-si-politici.json',execution_context:'No product source changes. Production metadata was read only. Business writes were confined to the dedicated synthetic r57 clone initialized from the checked A07 dump, internal Docker network with no public ports, 0 active schedulers. At sealing time the owned clone remains active for the separately requested A09 AVD handoff; cleanup will be evidenced separately, with no later change to this report.',counts:{controls:controls.length,pipelines:v.pipelines.length,findings:F.length,checks_by_status:Object.fromEntries([...new Set(controls.map(x=>x.status))].map(s=>[s,controls.filter(x=>x.status===s).length]))},limitations:['The seven zone pipelines contain incomplete branches. Twenty-nine controls considered is not equivalent to twenty-nine complete functional E2Es.','Factual split/unsplit allocation/warehouse limits are distinct from product defects; lack of new policy does not establish a bug.','Android AVD/physical scanner and iOS installation were not executed in this R2 agent report. A09 owns their results.','Fiscal conclusions require evidence per scheme, currency and organization. A05 tests concern the synthetic GardenWorld accounting framework.', 'Separate reports A03 and A06–A10 are cross-linked with hashes. A12 checks all individual tasks and A11 decides quality.']};
